      {
        "id": 3172,
        "post_date_time": "2011-07-11T17:37:00",
        "user_username": "someotherguy",
        "post_content_html": "<blockquote class=\"postcontent restore \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tI've got so many before &amp; afters it's sick.<br>\n<br>\n'92 C1500 extended cab longbed before:<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/92_00s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n'92 C1500 extended cab longbed after more stuff than I can list:<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/92_37s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n---<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n'94 C1500 Suburban before:<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/quickies/94sub_01s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n'94 C1500 Suburban after rims, 2/2 drop, stereo install, clear corners/tails, etc.:<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/quickies/94sub_15s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n---<br>\n<br>\n'94 C2500LD before:<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/rh94_01s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n'94 C2500LD after more stuff than I can list (and it's kind of an old pic, more done now):<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/rh94_58s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n---<br>\n<br>\n'94 3500HD before:<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/35hd_02s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n'94 3500HD after...you guessed it...more than I can list <img src=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/images/smilies/gr_grin.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" class=\"inlineimg\"><br>\n<img src=\"http://www.someotherplace.com/bb/projects/35hd_158s.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\nWrite-ups with a million pictures in the link in my sig...<br>\n<br>\nRichard\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>"
      },
