" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"http://www.tribalvisiontruck.com/images/box800.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>Looks stock to me. What did you modify? <br>\n<br>\nTruck looks sick as hell!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>"
