      {
        "id": 3179,
        "post_date_time": "2011-07-11T18:41:00",
        "user_username": "someotherguy",
        "post_content_html": "<blockquote class=\"postcontent restore \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n\t<div class=\"bbcode_quote\">\n\t\t<div class=\"quote_container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bbcode_quote_container\"></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bbcode_postedby\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/images/styles/gametime_red/misc/quote_icon.png\" alt=\"Quote\" title=\"Quote\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Chin Strap</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/image-gallery/snapshots-videos/478693-before-after-thread.html#post5351946\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/images/styles/gametime_red/buttons/viewpost-right.png\" alt=\"View Post\" title=\"View Post\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"message\">I really like that 3500HD, Id like to see some 95+ mirrors on it, but anything beats those elephant ears that were on here before those chrome ones.<br>\n<br>\nAlso nice smoked cab lights Rich.</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>Thanks, wish I still had that truck.  I chose the dumbo ears because they still gave me a good viewing area for towing but weren't ridiculously large.  The large plastic mirrors are OK but since I was running a parts business, those mirrors are in high demand so I sold the few good ones to my customers and used dumbos for the shop truck.  By the way, those aren't the smoked cab lights, but the plain clear ones - Recon offers them both ways.  Smoked would have looked good too but I wanted them to match with the clear corners I chose.<br>\n<br>\nRichard\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3180,
        "post_date_time": "2011-07-11T18:59:00",
        "user_username": "Chin Strap",
        "post_content_html": "<blockquote class=\"postcontent restore \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n\t<div class=\"bbcode_quote\">\n\t\t<div class=\"quote_container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bbcode_quote_container\"></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bbcode_postedby\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/images/styles/gametime_red/misc/quote_icon.png\" alt=\"Quote\" title=\"Quote\"> Originally Posted by <strong>someotherguy</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/image-gallery/snapshots-videos/478693-before-after-thread.html#post5352006\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"http://www.fullsizechevy.com/forum/images/styles/gametime_red/buttons/viewpost-right.png\" alt=\"View Post\" title=\"View Post\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"message\">Thanks, wish I still had that truck.  I chose the dumbo ears because they still gave me a good viewing area for towing but weren't ridiculously large.  The large plastic mirrors are OK but since I was running a parts business, those mirrors are in high demand so I sold the few good ones to my customers and used dumbos for the shop truck.  By the way, those aren't the smoked cab lights, but the plain clear ones - Recon offers them both ways.  Smoked would have looked good too but I wanted them to match with the clear corners I chose.<br>\n<br>\nRichard</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>Ohh, I see, you must of misread a little bit of what I said, the aforementioned dumbo ears were the ones in the 'Before' picture, I must not of made myself clear, but yeah, I know some people call the 88-94 chrome mirrors dumbo ears too, but I think they are alright.  <br>\n<br>\nI never understood why the 3500s have that piece in between the bumper and grill, do they come with 3' body lifts from the factory and thats their filler piece?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3181,
        "post_date_time": "2011-07-11T19:12:00",
        "user_username": "TheBigBlackHD",
        "post_content_html": "<blockquote class=\"postcontent restore \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe HD before:<br>\n<img src=\"http://i392.photobucket.com/albums/pp1/CameronZ71/NEWTRUCKE13413.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\nThe HD now:<br>\n<img src=\"http://i392.photobucket.com/albums/pp1/CameronZ71/Mobile%20Uploads/IMG00169-20110518-1742.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/265036_10150224235225688_501230687_7306363_1633386_n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\nMy 99 Z71 before:<br>\n<img src=\"http://i146.photobucket.com/albums/r271/FatCamZ71/100_1283.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<img src=\"http://i146.photobucket.com/albums/r271/FatCamZ71/100_1715.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\nWhen I traded it:<br>\n<img src=\"http://i392.photobucket.com/albums/pp1/CameronZ71/DSC01808.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\"><br>\n<img src=\"http://i392.photobucket.com/albums/pp1/CameronZ71/DSC01810.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" onload=\"NcodeImageResizer.createOn(this);\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>"
      },
